Q3","e":"pten","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Hendricks","x":"This decision resulted in a $12.4 million charge in direct operating cost, as well as a $2.2 million of severance expense in SG&A. Excluding these charges, the gross-profit margin for our other operations during the third quarter was $6.4 million on revenues and $25.7 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/patterson-uti-energy-pten-q3-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"PTEN 2019 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Hendricks","x":"While we made some headway to rightsize the business during a period of declining activity, we still have work to do in early 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/patterson-uti-energy-pten-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"PTEN 2019 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2020-02-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Hendricks","x":"It's really about what are we doing on the back end from the maintenance systems and other systems and what can we do to take a little bit more cost out of those structures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/06/patterson-uti-energy-pten-q4-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q1","e":"pten","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Smith","x":"This $50 million of charges is expected to be recouped within approximately six months through cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/patterson-uti-energy-pten-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q1","e":"pten","d":"2020-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Hendricks","x":"Excluding potential restructuring charges in the second quarter, we expect our pressure pumping segment to be adjusted EBITDA positive despite revenues declining sequentially by more than 50%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/24/patterson-uti-energy-pten-q1-2020-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q2","e":"pten","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Smith","x":"The $55.8 million of pre-tax charges includes $38.3 million of restructuring costs and $17.5 million of non-cash impairment charges, of which $8.3 million is included in depreciation, depletion and amortization, and is related to the closure of our Canadian drilling operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q2","e":"pten","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Smith","x":"Excluding the restructuring charges and non-cash impairment charges, adjusted EBITDA would have been $61.6 million for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q2-2020-earnings-cal.aspx"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2021-02-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"William A. Hendricks","x":"This edge server device installed at the well site allows for the streaming of high frequency data which can be combined with the analytical power of our PTEN+ performance center to drive informed decisions and improve efficiency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2021-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William A. Hendricks","x":"We're definitely focused on margins and maximizing those margins wherever we can, whether it's the drilling rigs, it's pressure pumping or it's directional drilling etc. And so we're going to try to get some pricing power when we can.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2021-02-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"William A. Hendricks","x":"I think we will see, in our case, may be different than others, but I think we'll see our drilling rig business grow at a faster pace on the top line and that's a combination of activity and maybe the possibility of some pricing power later in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"PTEN 2020 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William A. Hendricks","x":"With better fixed cost coverage and the benefits of the cost reduction efforts implemented in 2020, gross margin improved in the fourth quarter to $2.2 million or 12.8% of revenues from $0.5 million or 5% of revenues in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q4-2020-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"PTEN 2021 Q2","e":"pten","d":"2021-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Andrew Hendricks","x":"I mean, it offers a lot of benefits for the customer in terms of cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/30/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q2-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"PTEN 2021 Q3","e":"pten","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"C. Andrew Smith","x":"On a per day basis, the revenue benefit from the pass-through of higher wages is expected to be largely offset by various items.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"PTEN 2021 Q3","e":"pten","d":"2021-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"C. Andrew Smith","x":"This relative tightness is driving price increases for our services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/29/patterson-uti-energy-inc-pten-q3-2021-earnings-cal/"},{"c":"PTEN 2025 Q1","e":"pten","d":"2025-04-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Andrew Smith","x":"And then on the tariff side, it's still pretty early to put too fine a point on it, so I won't.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earni