2/patterson-uti-pten-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PTEN 2025 Q2","e":"pten","d":"2025-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"C. Andrew Smith","x":"So all of that kind of operates in the background and probably not very visible to you guys, but it's all designed to sort of make us more efficient and take cost out of the system.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/patterson-uti-pten-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PTEN 2025 Q3","e":"pten","d":"2025-10-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"William Hendricks","x":"But when we look at some of the opportunities as you get into the larger power structures, the AI and data centers are demanding, you're at the 200-megawatt plus.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/patterson-uti-pten-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PTEN 2025 Q3","e":"pten","d":"2025-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"William Hendricks","x":"Fleet Stream will provide data visualization and analytics, a platform to acquire and analyze reservoir measurements and streamline data workflows for our customers and provide a new revenue stream for our Completion Services segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/patterson-uti-pten-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PTEN 2025 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Saurabh Pant","x":"So it should be good for your pricing power in the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/patterson-uti-pten-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PTEN 2025 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2026-02-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Saurabh Pant","x":"So maybe just talk to that dynamic a little bit, differentiation and pricing power and how pricing has held up a lot better.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/patterson-uti-pten-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PTEN 2025 Q4","e":"pten","d":"2026-02-05","l":"cost_cuts","